WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
THE ORICHALCUM WARRIOR

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.480
Listen up!

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:09.100
Dai, the Hero was lost in the waters
near the Field of Death!

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:14.410
While he was wounded by Lord Hadlar,
no one believes he died!

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.400
He's alive out there somewhere!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:25.250
The Mystic Legion must be the first
to find Dai and kill him!

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:30.070
We must distinguish ourselves
for Dark King Vearn's praise!

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.920
Now go! Mystic Legion, go forth!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.720
Dai, where are you?!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.550
Leave this to me and my nose!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.060
Find something?!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.350
My nose froze.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.560
I figured as much!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:58.030
Regardless, there won't be any smell
to detect in this environment.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:02.530
That girl, Merle, could have been
a real help here.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.450
She has that strange power.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:12.000
We couldn't bring her here.
She's just a defenseless Seer.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.170
I couldn't find a single clue
looking from the sky.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.590
In that case...

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.380
Yeah! Looks like it's
winter swimming for us!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.680
What?!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:24.850
Let's go!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:25.680
Right!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:28.220
Wait! Shouldn't you warm up first?!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:38.280
Uh-oh. I thought that
this was my chance to shine.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.740
This situation is very bad.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.110
I don't know how to swim.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:49.450
Huh?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.670
What?! What's your problem?!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.380
How dare a simple Man o' War laugh at me!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.100
That's it!

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.690
Listen, I've got a proposal.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.100
I'll make it worth your while.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.690
So cold!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.030
Th-This is hopeless!
I can barely last a few minutes!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:29.160
If he's down there,
not even Dai could survive!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:34.130
But if he's not here in the water,
searching is going to be near impossible.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:37.380
Another possibility is that
when he hit an iceberg,

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:40.180
he got buried inside of it.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.880
If that's the case...

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.630
how do we find him
from among all these icebergs?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.320
Why you...!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:01.360
Hey! How can you be fishing
at a time like this?!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:07.700
This may look like fishing to a layman,
but it has a purpose.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.540
My mind works on
a whole different level from yours.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.250
What?

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:15.750
Ah, it's back!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.880
What's that?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.510
A Man o' War I just tamed.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:26.220
I'm having it search for Dai
in return for food.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.260
Oh? You can do that?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:34.150
Of course. A Fat Rat is like
the king of the monster world.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:38.100
Any monster will bow before me.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.110
You can't be serious.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.150
Hey, did you find Dai?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.820
Oh! That's...!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.190
This is Dai's! I'm sure of it!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.200
Was that all?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:58.000
Did you really search everywhere?!
Wasn't there a human?!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.420
Dai...!

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:06.130
This proves that he's definitely nearby.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:09.680
Huh?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.010
Oh, the food I promised.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.230
Hold on. I haven't caught it yet.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.820
What a temper.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.740
Dai... Don't die. Don't die out there.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.120
I swear I'll find you!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:40.340
No matter how many hundreds
or thousands of icebergs there are...

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.960
I swear I'll find you!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.500
Dai!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.840
<i>Dai!</i>

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.760
Popp?

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:58.060
I thought I heard Popp's voice.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:03.150
Could the others be nearby?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.570
Okay...!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:13.620
This is the last bit of Aura I have left!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.740
Popp... Everyone...

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.840
Please... find me!

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.210
Popp!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.380
Could that pillar of light be...?!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.140
The Dragon Crest!

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.270
It's Dai!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.180
Hey! Wait up!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.310
I'm still numb.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.400
You wait here.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.980
Garuda!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.160
<i>This is pathetic.</i>

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.240
<i>It's just me...</i>

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.080
Huh?

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.250
Popp!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.540
He survived!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.710
I knew he was all right, that rascal!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.220
Right! Your voice must have reached him!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.890
What is it, Big Guy?!

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.470
Our enemy has also noticed!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.020
It must be a search team
sent by Zaboera to find Dai.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.740
I'll take care of them!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:30.660
Melt the iceberg and rescue Dai!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.360
Will you be okay alone, Big Guy?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:39.990
Don't you think it's a little soon
for you to worry about me, Popp?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.330
All right then! I'll leave this to you!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.350
That's far enough!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.900
There you are, Zaboera.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.540
Curse you, Crocodine!

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:20.580
Traitors have no business here!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:26.800
You always hide in the shadows
and never get your hands dirty.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:30.290
Yet here you are with your servants.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:36.800
I'm guessing you've lost standing
within the Dark Army.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.470
W-Why you...!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:44.310
When you hide behind others,
leeching off their efforts

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:49.310
and never work to better yourself,
you're bound to end up

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.860
exactly where you are now!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:57.280
Shut up! I'll take care of
both you and Dai!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.410
Get him!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.890
I guess the time apart
has made you forget...

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.560
the power of the Beast King!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.190
Flying Flayers!

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.780
Looks like they've started.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.700
Oh no! The light!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.910
The light of the crest is fading!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.120
P-Popp...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.330
Dai!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:03.720
I have to hurry! They need me out there!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.570
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.570
ULTRA COMBUSTION SLASH

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:38.300
Zaboera has discovered Dai
and headed out to the frozen sea.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:43.010
The fool has gotten ahead of himself.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:47.350
Hym, use force if necessary.
Bring Zaboera back.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.480
My lord.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:53.270
No one shall touch
Dai and his friends but me!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.640
There! Found him!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.350
I need to be careful from here.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:32.810
What are you standing around for!
Leave this to me!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:33.650
Huh?!

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:35.690
Rattus Rocket Ram!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.570
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.070
You idiot!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.370
-Dai!
-Dai!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.910
Dai! Dai, hang in there!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:56.960
Popp...

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.170
I knew it was you.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:04.630
Obviously. Who else
would come to rescue you?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.140
And me! And me!
Don't forget about me, Dai!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.680
Chiu, carry that sword!
We're getting out of here!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:17.400
Huh? But what about my praise?

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.520
Tsk!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.570
<i>How can a sword so small weigh so much?</i>

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.580
Zaboera?!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.540
What?! How did he get there?!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.130
Flying Flayers! Cast Kafrizz on me!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.640
W-What?!

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.940
This is my greatest trump card,

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:58.980
the convergence spell, Hexcitation!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.360
It's a Super Spell that
lets me absorb others' spells,

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.070
add my own power
and fire the combined energy!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.660
With the combined Kafrizz spells
from me and my Flying Flayers,

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.790
I'll evaporate you and that iceberg!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.750
Dai! Popp!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.790
<i>If I run with a Zoom spell,
it'll hit Chiu behind me!</i>

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.500
<i>Can I cancel it out
with a spell of my own?!</i>

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.710
Die!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.390
What?! W-What happened?!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.720
What is that?!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.760
Who is this guy?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.310
A man made of metal?!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:18.850
Is it a new enemy?!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.560
But why did it save them?!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.980
Y-You!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.570
Who are you?!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.030
Why do you get in my way?!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.370
Even Zaboera doesn't recognize him?!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:41.330
I am Lord Hadlar's loyal soldier,
the pawn, Hym!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.830
Hym?!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.170
<i>Did he say pawn?!</i>

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:53.840
By Lord Hadlar's order I've come
to retrieve your disobedient hide.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.170
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.460
You little brat! Take this!

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.940
Impossible! My spell didn't work?!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:55.740
Come to think of it,
you already repelled my Hexcitation spell.

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.620
What are you?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.200
Fool!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:06.330
I am one of the ultimate guards created
from an Orichalcum piece by Lord Hadlar!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.920
My entire body is made of Orichalcum!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:14.680
I am invulnerable to
all attacks and spells!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:21.720
Only Lord Hadlar with his Orichalcum blade
or the omnipotent Dark King can harm me.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.230
What?!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:27.940
You there!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.400
Huh?!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.530
Is that your sword?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:39.530
The owner of that sword
might actually put up a good fight.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.240
Then why not kill us here?!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.830
Why bother protecting us?!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:50.090
I'm not a piece of scum like him.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.430
I'm a proud servant of Lord Hadlar!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:56.880
I will face any opponent head-on!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:02.850
Killing you in such a cheap way
would be boring!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:09.560
I protect the Field of Death with
my four comrades by Lord Hadlar's order!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.070
We shall cross paths eventually.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:16.160
You'd better train
for when that day comes!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:19.240
Don't disappoint Lord Hadlar!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.290
Are you okay?

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.960
Y-Yeah.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.840
I guess we were rescued by our enemy.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:39.220
Big Guy, that guy said he was a pawn.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.230
By pawn, did he mean...?

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:45.470
Yes. It's the name
of the weakest chess piece.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.480
That was the weakest?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.860
It's a scary thought, but it seems so.

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.190
Let's go back, guys.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:01.490
We've got a lot to do
when we get back to Papnica.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.290
You're right. Good point.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:08.410
I completely forgot
you're wounded and half-frozen.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.580
That's cold.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.220
Let's go! Back to Papnica!

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:19.300
We can figure things out then.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.730
Ow, ow, ow!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.980
Do something about your landing!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:33.150
Don't blame me! I'm overburdened!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.570
Dai! Everyone!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.570
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.830
I told you to leave it to me.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:43.290
You should have seen me out there.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.160
Dai!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.080
Huh?

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:49.830
Oh! Dai! Dai!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.210
Thank goodness!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:00.760
How dare...?!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:06.350
You don't have the power
to escape that cage.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:09.270
You can cool your head there.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.600
Wait! Wait!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.650
Curse you Hadlar!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:20.070
How dare you steal my glory!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:25.750
It's time to see Hadlar's
newly assembled royal guard.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:32.370
Giving him five whole Orichalcum warriors
was rather generous of you, King Vearn.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.420
Why shouldn't I?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.930
Mere Gargoyles and Archdemons

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:42.010
wouldn't be strong enough
to be Hadlar's guard now.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.010
At last.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.640
Oh great Dark King Vearn,

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.780
I present to you my new servants.

00:20:55.780 --> 00:21:00.570
Five pieces born from
everlasting Orichalcum.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:05.490
First is the pawn, Hym.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.490
PAWN: HYM

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.580
The knight, Sigma.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.290
KNIGHT: SIGMA

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.370
The bishop, Fenbren.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.960
BISHOP: FENBREN

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.250
The rook, Block.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.800
ROOK: BLOCK

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:24.720
And the queen, Albinass.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.720
QUEEN: ALBINASS

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:30.810
This is the ultimate force
to protect the Field of Death...

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.560
the Hadlar Royal Guard!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.940
Magnificent, Hadlar.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.770
You are the king of that royal guard.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.330
When the Disciples of Avan are defeated,

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:50.910
and the world is conquered,
I shall grant you the surface world.

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:52.700
When that time comes,

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.710
you may reclaim your title of Dark Lord.

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.380
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.430
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.780
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.700
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:30.410
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.540
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:48.130
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.980
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:11.660
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:36.520
<i>The showdown
with Dark King Vearn is decided.</i>

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.650
<i>The Disciples of Avan
begin their individual training.</i>

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.860
<i>To fight the Hadlar Royal Guard,
who are immune to magic,</i>

00:23:42.860 --> 00:23:45.240
<i>Popp visits his mentor, Matoriv.</i>

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:49.990
<i>In order to learn the ultimate spell
that even Matoriv fears to use,</i>

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:53.280
<i>Popp begins a deadly training.</i>

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.750
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.750 --> 00:23:58.210
<i>"The Extreme Annihilation Spell, Medroa"</i>

00:23:58.210 --> 00:24:00.000
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
